    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "AN OUTSTANDING ADDRESS - PRESENTING THIS SUPERB FOUR-BEDROOM DETACHED FAMILY HOME, 5 MINUTES FROM LONGFORD TOWN.\r\n\r\nIt gives us great pleasure here at Davis Auctioneers to bring to the market, this fantastic four-bedroom, detached property, just a few minutes’ drive from the N4 and Longford Town. This property, together with a large, detached garage, is positioned on a mature site, with a south facing rear garden.\r\n\r\n\r\nMeasuring c.2,055 sq.ft. the layout comprises of a wide welcoming entrance hall, kitchen/dining room, sitting room, living room, sunroom, utility room and wc on the ground floor. There are four large bedrooms, master en-suite with walk in wardrobe, and a large family bathroom on the first floor. \r\n\r\nKnockloughlin, is a brilliantly located address, only a few minutes’ drive from the villages of Enybegs, Newtownforbes and Ballinalee, just a five-minute drive north of Longford Town. The much sought after National Schools at Enybegs and Melview are both within a five-minute drive.\r\n\r\nThis property, with its large site, mature shrubs & trees, tarmacadam driveway, entrance walls and gates, as well as many more outstanding features, is expected to generate huge interest. If you are considering the perfect family home, remote working being a priority, or just simply seeking a superb address in the heart of the midlands, this one is worth a visit.\r\n\r\nViewing of this beautiful home is highly recommended by the sole Auctioneers.\r\n\r\nPlease call to us at 53 Main Street, Longford or contact us on 043 3350555 to book your viewing.\r\n\r\nEIRCODE: N39 H1X8\r\n\r\nFOLIO NO. LD10460F"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Overall Floor Area: 191m2\r\n\r\nEntrance hall: 4.30m x 2.40m\r\n\r\nSitting room: 4.00m x 5.35m\r\n\r\nLiving room: 3.30m x 4.90m\r\n\r\nKitchen/dining room: 3.85m x 6.30m\r\n\r\nSunroom: 3.60m x 3.00m\r\n\r\nUtility W/C: 3.60m x 3.90m\r\n\r\nBed 1: 3.96m x 4.15m\r\nEn-suite: 1.25m x 2.05m\r\n\r\nBed 2: 3.30m x 3.70m\r\n\r\nBed 3: 3.30m x 4.30m\r\n\r\nBed 4: 3.60m x 3.85m \r\n\r\nBathroom: 2.45 x 2.50m"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "South Facing rear Garden and Sunroom\r\n\r\nDetached Garage \r\n\r\nGarden neatly presented with shrubs, trees and garden lights\r\n\r\n3.5 km from Abbott Diagnostics Ireland (Longford’s largest employer)\r\n\r\nSpacious Patio area to the rear\r\n\r\nSpacious ensuite bedroom with walk in wardrobe\r\n\r\nLocated just 3.5 km off the N4\r\n\r\nEntrance walls and gates\r\n\r\nTarmac driveway providing vehicle access to the rear\r\n\r\nSecure mature boundaries with hedging and fences\r\n\r\nHugely sought-after area with excellent National & secondary Schools close by\r\n\r\nNewtownfobes, Drumlish, Ballinalee, Killoe & Longford Town just a few minutes drive\r\n\r\nExcellent Broadband\r\n\r\nBus service to Secondary Schools in Longford \r\n\r\nLongford Train Station: 10 Minute drive\r\n\r\n7 Trains a day on the Dublin-Sligo Line\r\n\r\nCommute to Dublin- 1 hour & 20 mins\r\n\r\nDouble Glazed Pvc Windows and Doors\r\n\r\nLarge kitchen-dining area\r\nUtility area with fitted units \r\nOil fired central heating\r\nStove in the living room\r\n\r\nGas fireplace in the sitting room\r\n\r\nMains water and septic tank system\r\n\r\nBER CERT C1"
      },
